      "name": "How many watts does a generator need to run a fridge?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
       "@type": "Answer",
       "text": "A non-inverter fridge runs at about 200 W but needs about 1,200 W at start, so plan on that peak plus whatever else is running. An inverter fridge runs at about 120 W and starts at about 200 W."
      }
     },
     {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What can a 2,000 watt generator run?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
