      "name": "What is a generator load calculator?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
       "@type": "Answer",
       "text": "It adds up the running watts of the appliances you will use together, adds the largest starting surge, and gives the watts and kVA your generator must supply. This page is one; the home generator size calculator does the same for a whole house list."
      }
